  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/smol-machines/smolvm/zipball/v1.24.0",
  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Fall back to a synchronous save for a stored checkpoint the VMM cannot defer by @LoganGrasby in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1584\n* Pin a fork's golden layers on pause instead of packing them into every artifact by @LoganGrasby in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1585\n* Rebuild the image seeds machines used recently when a server starts, so the first machine of each image after an upgrade does not wait for a seed build by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1586\n* Fix private CA registry pulls and image seeds by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1587\n* Wake TCP relay threads on readiness instead of polling every 10 ms by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1588\n* Let exec/interactive take an argument vector and run on pipes by @adam-r-kowalski in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1538\n* Refuse pinned branch ports on a machine that publishes none by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1589\n* Let the embedded runtime keep a branch's source frozen as a reusable branch base by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1590\n* Bump version to 1.24.0 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1591\n\n## New Contributors\n* @adam-r-kowalski made their first contribution in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1538\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.23.7...v1.24.0",
